@che_agraria
title: La reforma agraria en armas
subtitle: Move the land now, in the zone, as a working fact — the deepest root there is.
card-image: img/cards/expropiacion.jpg
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; apoyo_popular += 8; sup_peasants += 4; pres_guerrero += 2; represion += 2; linea_guerra -= 2

Not the promise of land after victory — the land, now, walked out by the families who bled on it as peons, the cacique's fences down on ground the column holds. It is the single most powerful thing the war can do, because it converts a peasant who *sympathizes* into a peasant who has something concrete and irreversible to defend, and a peasant with something to defend hides you, feeds you, and lies to the lieutenant with a clear conscience. The state understands the danger and answers it, always, in force. Let it. The root is already down.

@che_medica
title: La brigada médica
subtitle: Treat the sick, deliver the babies, bury the dead with respect — the war the state cannot match.
card-image: img/adelitas.jpg
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; apoyo_popular += 6; moral_columnas += 2; disciplina += 2; sup_peasants += 2

The comandante sets up the clinic the government never built, in the village the government never visited except to count votes it stole. Vaccinations, the difficult births, the machete wounds that used to end in gangrene — and around the medicine, without a word of doctrine required, the argument makes itself: *these are the people who come when you are dying, and those are the people who come when you are voting.* A movement that heals the body it claims to be fighting for earns a loyalty no communiqué can buy and no reprisal can fully burn.

@che_educacion
title: La educación política
subtitle: Teach the letters and the reasons together — a people that reads its own condition.
card-image: img/cards/circulos_estudio.jpg
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; apoyo_popular += 5; prestigio_socialismo += 2; disciplina += 3; sup_students += 2

The literacy class that is also a consciousness: the campesino learning to read using the words *land*, *wage*, *dignity*, discovering in the same hour both that he can decode a sentence and that his poverty is a decision someone made, not a weather he must endure. It is the slowest of all the work and the deepest — a village that can read its own condition cannot be un-taught it, and cannot, afterward, be governed quite the way it was before. The comandante calls it the only conquest that holds: the mind that has understood does not surrender the ground it stands on.
